    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play Free Prologue</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/03840dd65eabf83f29a058b96b417a35.avif?t=1735815668\" /></div><br><br>Our Kickstarter preregistration page is now live. Preregister now so you don't miss out when Kickstarter goes live sometime soon. You won't want to miss out all the cool early-bird perks. <br><br>LAST SOUL is a 2D Pixel-Art, Shooter, Action, Platformer with a compelling story about a future where mankind is losing its will to live.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get cover</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use shields to protect yourself from the bullet hell that enemies spread towards you. You need to also use these shields as a platform when reaching the higher ground.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dash</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dash and destroy. With dash, you are fast as F boi! Often the attack is the best defense.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bullet time</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Last Soul is a fast-paced game, and there is a lot\u2019s going on around you. Control the time and use the bullet time to dodge enemies bullets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Big guns</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You need big guns to destroy big bosses. Collect them all and spread mayhem around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fly like a hawk</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Death from above! Use a jetpack and fly like a bird. Enemies don\u2019t even notice what did hit them.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as an AI robot tasked with saving humanity.  <br></li><li>Explore and fight your way through tens of distinct regions.<br></li><li>Enjoy the amazing PixelArt graphic and an immersive music style.<br></li><li>Evolve your character, unlock new and more powerful weapons and abilities.<br></li><li>Master special powers, including bullet time, jet pack, and shields.<br></li><li>Take on awesome boss fights, or die trying.<br></li><li>Make your best speedrunner time and show off on the leaderboard<br></li><li>Discover Easter Eggs, boost your points, and get a totally different skin from the rest</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/03840dd65eabf83f29a058b96b417a35.avif?t=1735815668\" /></div><br><br>Our Kickstarter preregistration page is now live. Preregister now so you don't miss out when Kickstarter goes live sometime soon. You won't want to miss out all the cool early-bird perks. <br><br>LAST SOUL is a 2D Pixel-Art, Shooter, Action, Platformer with a compelling story about a future where mankind is losing its will to live.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get cover</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/c35253c52e074cd86951f31158585237.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use shields to protect yourself from the bullet hell that enemies spread towards you. You need to also use these shields as a platform when reaching the higher ground.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dash</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/ef86188e144663f749ab9fbf2c14c854.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dash and destroy. With dash, you are fast as F boi! Often the attack is the best defense.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bullet time</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/db367fa840273de122143d5b6cca55c6.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Last Soul is a fast-paced game, and there is a lot\u2019s going on around you. Control the time and use the bullet time to dodge enemies bullets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Big guns</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/2290fc6f132f122dc9fe815a3b024fcd.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You need big guns to destroy big bosses. Collect them all and spread mayhem around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fly like a hawk</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.poster.avif?t=1735815668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.webm?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566040/extras/1ae3e1787acf93e6411d551cf6e8a7ce.mp4?t=1735815668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Death from above! Use a jetpack and fly like a bird. Enemies don\u2019t even notice what did hit them.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as an AI robot tasked with saving humanity.  <br></li><li>Explore and fight your way through tens of distinct regions.<br></li><li>Enjoy the amazing PixelArt graphic and an immersive music style.<br></li><li>Evolve your character, unlock new and more powerful weapons and abilities.<br></li><li>Master special powers, including bullet time, jet pack, and shields.<br></li><li>Take on awesome boss fights, or die trying.<br></li><li>Make your best speedrunner time and show off on the leaderboard<br></li><li>Discover Easter Eggs, boost your points, and get a totally different skin from the rest</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Shoot them all, jump, climb, use jetpack, shields, and platforms, slow time, and discover secrets on this hectic Sci-Fi adventure where you become the last hope of mankind in the shape of an awesome robot.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Danish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Swedish, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s a fun looking game with vibrant pixel art visuals and challenging old school action platforming gameplay.\u201d<br>Alphabetagamer<br><br>\u201cThe visual style of the game also stands out with very detailed pixel-art, memorable character designs, and vivid colors.\u201d<br>GameRamble<br>",
